Subject: [PATCH 00915/11171] [outer-loop] preserve #1 powered RFT
 (max_new=1024) flagged run + gitignore ARC SDK cache

3-seed powered on-policy SC-RFT, 5h16m. Gold control passes (+0.262 mean -> RFT teaches).
process_weighted +0.091 mean (largest non-gold lift, > sc_weighted +0.027) BUT 2/3 seeds
TRUNCATION_INVALID (seed0 0.093, seed1 0.067; seed2 clean 0.047) -> verbosity confound.
Preserved as *_maxnew1024.json; canonical names will carry the clean 4096-eval rerun.
Also gitignore environment_files/ + recordings/ (arc-agi SDK local cache).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
